#  Superstore Business Performance Dashboard

**Power BI | DAX | Data Modeling | Time Intelligence | Business Intelligence**

## Project Overview

This project analyzes Superstore sales performance using Power BI and DAX to evaluate revenue, profitability, customer activity, regional performance, returns, and year over year growth.

The solution was developed using a semantic model consisting of a central Orders fact table connected to supporting People and Returns tables. Advanced DAX measures were created to support profitability analysis, return rate reporting, category comparisons, and time intelligence calculations.

